# Product & Cost Guardrails

Canonical docs (read when changing product/backend direction):

- `docs/PRODUCT.md` — product vision + § Voice
- `docs/TECH.md` — stack, folders, coach mock note
- `.cursor/rules/product-voice.mdc` / `.cursorrules` — user-facing copy standard
- `.cursor/rules/safety-and-coach.mdc` — coach safety contract

## Cost

Stay cheap and local until product direction says otherwise:

- No login, no database, no paid analytics/Sentry without TECH approval.
- **No LLM provider yet.** Coach replies are mock / deterministic in `lib/server/coach/`.
- Do not add `openai`, Anthropic, Gemini, Groq, OpenRouter, or any LLM API key env vars until `docs/TECH.md` is updated.
- Zero secrets required to run the app locally.

## Stack baseline

**App:** Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19, Tailwind 4, Zod 4, TypeScript strict, Zustand for in-page chat state.

## Auth / data

No auth. No persistence. Conversation history lives in the page session (Zustand) only.
